R7 webhook/payment docs:
ILIGUIDE_SETUP.md:34:supabase functions deploy paymongo-webhook
ILIGUIDE_SETUP.md:50:Create a PayMongo webhook at `https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1/paymongo-webhook` and subscribe it to `checkout_session.payment.paid`, `checkout_session.payment.failed`, and `payment.refund.updated`. Copy its endpoint secret into `PAYMONGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. The frontend never treats the checkout redirect as payment confirmation.
ILIGUIDE_SETUP.md:66:- Booking holds last ten minutes and use database-side fee and capacity checks. Free bookings confirm through a database RPC. Paid bookings redirect to PayMongo Checkout and become confirmed only after a signed webhook.
