README.md:34:supabase functions deploy paymongo-webhook
README.md:52:Create a PayMongo webhook at `https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1/paymongo-webhook` and subscribe it to `checkout_session.payment.paid`, `checkout_session.payment.failed`, and `payment.refund.updated`. Copy its endpoint secret into `PAYMONGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. The frontend never treats the checkout redirect as payment confirmation.
README.md:60:- Booking holds last ten minutes and use database-side fee and capacity checks. The current visitor flow confirms the reservation without online payment; displayed fees are estimates to be paid under the destination's own admission process. PayMongo checkout, webhook, and refund functions remain available but are not called by the current visitor interface.
